  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "がったいした　キュレムと\nあるポケモンを　もとどおりに\nぶんりさせる　いっついの　くさび。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "합체한 큐레무와\n어떤 포켓몬을 원래대로\n분리시키는 한 쌍의 쐐기.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能讓合體後的\n酋雷姆和某寶可夢\n分離至原狀的一對楔子。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un outil qui permet de séparer Kyurem et\nle Pokémon avec lequel il a fusiorbé.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Keil, der Kyurem und ein gewisses anderes\nPokémon, die vereinigt wurden, voneinander trennt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Punta que permite separar a Kyurem del Pokémon\ncon el que se ha fusionado.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cuneo che permette di separare Kyurem\ndal Pokémon con cui era fuso.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A splicer that separates Kyurem and a certain\nPokémon when they have been fused.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "合体した　キュレムと\nあるポケモンを　元通りに\n分離させる　一対の　くさび。",
